{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44892","headline":"奉和段着作山居呈诸同志三首次本韵 三 · 无可","name":"奉和段着作山居呈诸同志三首次本韵 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蹔收丹陛迹，独往乱山居。\n入雪知人远，眠云觉俗虚。\n足垂岩顶石，缨濯洞中渠。\n只见僧酬答，新归绝壑书。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无可","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44892.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44892","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}